{
  "name": "Daily AI Summaries to Steemit Sync Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "tableName": "daily_ai_summaries",
        "watchForColumns": "id,date,title,content,article_count",
        "additionalFields": {
          "schema": "public"
        }
      },
      "id": "steemit-sync-trigger-id",
      "name": "New Summary Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabaseTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "steemit-sync-webhook",
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "mnS6q7Jby2UblcPc",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "/**\n * 处理新增的摘要数据\n * 检查是否需要发布到Steemit\n */\nfunction processNewSummary() {\n  const triggerData = $json;\n  \n  // 检查触发类型是否为INSERT\n  if (triggerData.type !== 'INSERT') {\n    return null;\n  }\n  \n  const newRecord = triggerData.record;\n  \n  // 检查是否已经发布到Steemit\n  if (newRecord.steemit_posted === true) {\n    return null;\n  }\n  \n  // 检查必要字段是否存在\n  if (!newRecord.content || !newRecord.title || !newRecord.date) {\n    return null;\n  }\n  \n  return {\n    shouldProcess: true,\n    summaryData: newRecord\n  };\n}\n\nreturn processNewSummary();",
        "outputsCount": 1
      },
      "id": "process-trigger-data-id",
      "name": "Process Trigger Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        500,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-should-process",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.shouldProcess }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equal"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "check-should-process-id",
      "name": "Check Should Process",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        700,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "/**\n * 为新摘要格式化Steemit发布内容\n * 添加适当的标签、格式化markdown、生成永久链接\n */\nfunction formatSteemitContent() {\n  const data = $json.summaryData;\n  \n  // 生成Steemit友好的标题\n  const steemitTitle = `${data.date} AI新闻日报 | 今日科技前沿速递`;\n  \n  // 格式化内容，添加Steemit特有的元素\n  const steemitContent = `\n${data.content}\n\n---\n\n## 📊 本期统计\n\n- 📅 **发布日期**: ${data.date}\n- 📰 **精选文章**: ${data.article_count}篇\n- 🤖 **AI智能筛选**: 基于多维度评估算法\n- 🔗 **数据来源**: 权威科技媒体聚合\n\n## 🏷️ 相关标签\n\n#ai #technology #news #blockchain #steemit #中文 #科技 #人工智能 #新闻\n\n---\n\n> 🤖 **关于本文**\n> \n> 本文由AI自动生成和发布，内容来源于公开的科技新闻报道。我们致力于为中文用户提供最新、最有价值的AI科技资讯。\n> \n> 💡 **互动邀请**: 欢迎在评论区分享您对这些AI新闻的看法和见解！\n\n---\n\n*本文首发于 [Steemit](https://steemit.com) | 数据驱动，智能筛选*\n    `;\n\n    // 生成唯一的永久链接\n    const permlink = `ai-news-${data.date.replace(/-/g, '')}-${Date.now()}`;\n\n    return {\n      summaryId: data.id,\n      title: steemitTitle,\n      body: steemitContent,\n      tags: ['ai', 'technology', 'news', 'blockchain', 'steemit', '中文', '科技', '人工智能', '新闻'],\n      category: 'technology',\n      permlink: permlink,\n      originalDate: data.date,\n      originalTitle: data.title\n    };\n}\n\nreturn formatSteemitContent();",
        "outputsCount": 1
      },
      "id": "format-steemit-content-id",
      "name": "Format Steemit Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "/**\n * 准备Steemit API调用参数\n * 生成发布操作的完整参数\n */\nfunction prepareSteemitApiCall() {\n  const postData = $json;\n  \n  // Steemit发布操作参数\n  const commentOp = [\n    'comment',\n    {\n      parent_author: '',\n      parent_permlink: postData.category,\n      author: '{{ $credentials.steemitAccount.username }}',\n      permlink: postData.permlink,\n      title: postData.title,\n      body: postData.body,\n      json_metadata: JSON.stringify({\n        tags: postData.tags,\n        app: 'n8n-auto-poster/1.0',\n        format: 'markdown',\n        canonical_url: `https://steemit.com/@{{ $credentials.steemitAccount.username }}/${postData.permlink}`,\n        description: `${postData.originalDate} AI新闻综述 - 精选${postData.tags.length}个热门话题`\n      })\n    }\n  ];\n\n  return {\n    operation: commentOp,\n    postData: postData,\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n  };\n}\n\nreturn prepareSteemitApiCall();"
      },
      "id": "prepare-steemit-api-id",
      "name": "Prepare Steemit API Call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.steemit.com/",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          "User-Agent": "n8n-steemit-poster/1.0"
        },
        "body": {
          "jsonrpc": "2.0",
          "method": "condenser_api.broadcast_transaction",
          "params": [
            {
              "operations": [
                "={{ $json.operation }}"
              ],
              "signatures": [
                "{{ $credentials.steemitAccount.signature }}"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "id": "={{ Date.now() }}"
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "retry": {
            "enabled": true,
            "maxAttempts": 3,
            "waitBetween": 2000
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "post-to-steemit-id",
      "name": "Post to Steemit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1300,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "steemitAccount": {
          "id": "steemit-credentials-id",
          "name": "Steemit Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "/**\n * 处理Steemit API响应并准备数据库更新\n * 检查发布状态并生成相应的更新数据\n */\nfunction processSteemitResponse() {\n  const apiResponse = $json;\n  const postData = $('Prepare Steemit API Call').first().json.postData;\n  \n  let updateData = {\n    id: postData.summaryId,\n    steemit_posted_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  };\n\n  if (apiResponse.result && apiResponse.result.id) {\n    // 发布成功\n    updateData.steemit_posted = true;\n    updateData.steemit_url = `https://steemit.com/@{{ $credentials.steemitAccount.username }}/${postData.permlink}`;\n    updateData.steemit_transaction_id = apiResponse.result.id;\n    updateData.steemit_block_num = apiResponse.result.block_num;\n    updateData.steemit_status = 'published';\n  } else {\n    // 发布失败\n    updateData.steemit_posted = false;\n    updateData.steemit_error = JSON.stringify(apiResponse.error || 'Unknown error');\n    updateData.steemit_status = 'failed';\n    updateData.retry_count = (postData.retry_count || 0) + 1;\n  }\n\n  return updateData;\n}\n\nreturn processSteemitResponse();"
      },
      "id": "process-steemit-response-id",
      "name": "Process Steemit Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        0
      ]
    },
